SUMMARY:Lancaster Kidpreneur Day
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Kidpreneur Day is a one-day business fair for kids. Kids ages 6 to 14 sign up for a space\, bring something they made\, baked\, grew\, or bought to resell\, and sell it to whoever walks by. They keep every dollar they earn. Local business owners judge the tables and hand out cash prizes for Most Original Business Idea\, Highest Business Potential\, and Best Presentation.\n\nFree to come shop and cheer the kids on. Vendor spaces are $25 and limited. Run by The Lancaster Ledger. Register at thelancasterledger.com/kidpreneur. \n            \n        \n                \n                \n    Register Now
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/lancaster-kidpreneur-day/
LOCATION:Binns Park\, 120 North Queen Street\, Lancaster\, Pennsylvania\, 17603\, United States
CATEGORIES:Festivals & Annual Events
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://fig.guide/content/uploads/sites/3/2026/09/hero-illustration.avif
ORGANIZER;CN="The Lancaster Ledger":MAILTO:collin@thelancasterledger.com
END:VEVENT
