SUMMARY:Women's Worship\, Panel Discussion and More
DESCRIPTION:Come out for an evening of real women\, real stories and real encouragement as we dig into the Bible and discover how John 10:10 has impacted the lives of women around us. This evening will feature worship group Life Center Worship while also featuring panelist Denise Beverly\, Rebekah Marie Eager and Ashley Ewing. We will finish the evening with speaker and worship leader Tiffany Aitken. \n            \n        \n                \n            \n                \n                \n    Register Now
