SUMMARY:DEK of Hearts
DESCRIPTION:Experience country-pop sensation DEK of Hearts—finalists on NBC’s The Voice—live at the Ware Center!\n\nThis powerhouse Nashville-based trio blends country\, pop\, and bluegrass influences with soaring three-part harmonies and undeniable onstage chemistry. On The Voice\, they earned a rare 4-chair turn that famously put Reba McEntire on the floor and went on to finish as Top 3 finalists. Fresh off their Grand Ole Opry debut\, DEK of Hearts delivers an unforgettable live experience filled with energy\, authenticity\, and the kind of musical chemistry that has quickly established them as one of country music’s most exciting emerging independent acts.\n\nAdults $29 | Students $21 \n            \n        \n                \n            \n                \n                \n    Buy Tickets
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/dek-of-hearts/
LOCATION:Ware Center for the Arts\, 42 N. Prince St.\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17603\, United States
CATEGORIES:Arts & Entertainment
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://fig.guide/content/uploads/sites/3/2026/09/2026.10.10-DEK-of-Hearts.avif
ORGANIZER;CN="Millersville University Office of Visual & Performing Arts":MAILTO:cori.jackson@millersville.edu
END:VEVENT
