SUMMARY:Design Your Own Tote Bag: Lino Cut Stamps
DESCRIPTION:Learn the art of printmaking! In this hands-on\, entry-level workshop\, discover the start-to-finish process of creating a linoleum block print you can use to create images on paper and fabric. Leave with a tote bag featuring your own artwork! All materials are provided\, so hop right in and leave with work you can wear\, show off\, and use to carry all your favorite fall goodies. \n            \n        \n                \n            \n                \n                \n    Register Now
