SUMMARY:Solar Punk Party
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the release of Becky Chambers’ new book AS YOU WAKE\, BREAK THE SHELL with us! We are hosting a solarpunk-themed party to take joy in all things cozy\, green\, and hopeful. We’ll have so many signed copies of AS YOU WAKE\, BREAK THE SHELL for sale\, plus lots of other books to help you imagine a more sustainable future. \n\n\n\n Your $30 ticket includes a workshop with Gallery Grow to build your own carniverous terrarrium! We will also provide tea\, snacks\, trivia\, and so many book recommendations. \n\n\n\n\n\n\n    Buy Tickets
