SUMMARY:Bookmaking Crashcourse: Make your own Sketchbook at PCA&D
DESCRIPTION:Finding the perfect sketchbook or journal that fits your creative needs can sometimes prove challenging. But\, what if instead of spending countless hours searching for a good fit you could create the perfect book/journal tailored to you? \n\n\n\nJoin PC&D for an evening of beginner bookmaking to cut\, sew\, glue\, and create your own custom sketchbook/journal. This is a hands on studio workshop. You will receive both a demonstration and step by step guidance followed by time to use the skills learned in class. \n\n\n\n\n\n\n    Register Now
