SUMMARY:Little Terrarium of Terrors: A Happy Hour Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Get into the Halloween spirit at our Little Terrarium of Terrors Happy Hour Workshop! Build your own spooky terrarium featuring carnivorous plants\, eerie details\, and a touch of Halloween magic. You’ll learn how to care for these fascinating insect-eating plants and take home a hauntingly fun creation. Each participant will also receive one handmade figurine by local artist Maggie Mowery\, with additional figurines available for purchase during the workshop. \n            \n        \n                \n            \n                \n                \n    Buy Tickets
